                # possible if battle_flag got stuck at 1 after an encounter
                # ended instead of clearing, silently preventing any real
                # win/loss/XP resolution for the rest of the episode. This is
                # exactly the failure mode `_clear_stale_battle_flag_if_ready`
                # exists for; it force-clears the flag after N consecutive
                # steps with battle_flag set, zero enemy HP, and no text box
                # open. 96 is the lower of the two nonzero values already in
                # use elsewhere in this file (96/192) -- picked to recover
                # quickly without also cutting off a real, still-resolving
